<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55245" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-στᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fitted for calming</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔννοιαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1041.20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κ.</span>
			<i>power to calm</i>, of music, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταστηματικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκαταστατικός</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῖρα τοῦ Ἡλίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Rhetor.
				</span></i>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(1).247
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόν, τό</span>, perh.
			banker's <i>charge for weighing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PPetr.
				3p.191
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνηπλωμένως καὶ
					ἀφηγηματικῶς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aps.
				p.243
			</span></i> H., al.: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτερον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, διηγεῖσθαι</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				392
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβάλλειν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				616
			</span></i>.</div>
